{"id":"en_falling-deep","title":"Falling Deep","titleEn":"Falling Deep","description":"Asuna is a hardworking civil servant dealing with sexual harassment at her job and constant pressure from her parents. Her life takes a turn when she meets Rui, a host with an endearing, puppy-like manner who brings relief to her stressful days. Before long, however, she finds herself 70,000 yen in debt with her cards suspended. Even so, the sight of his smile makes everything seem bearable. What unfolds is a forbidden, love-hate spiral, pulling a once-proper young woman steadily downward.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/falling-deep/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/falling-deep/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Betrayal","Drama","Reality"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d98lu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_falling-deep_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d98lu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_falling-deep_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d98lu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_falling-deep_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d98lu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_falling-deep_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d98lu/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_falling-deep_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free